OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FClear and
OL,6,Fdry for much of the night across the
OL,7,Fregion with some patchy cloud across
OL,8,Fthe north. Feeling fresh and rather
OL,9,Fcool for all.
OL,10,
OL,11,CSaturday:FCloud will linger in the
OL,12,Fnorth first thing but will lift
OL,13,Fquickly. Bright and sunny into the
OL,14,Fafternoon, feeling pleasantly warm in
OL,15,Fthe sun.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
